("neltharion", "Neltharion / Deathwing", "CH", "Aspect of earth, the Earth-Warder — corrupted across millennia by the Old Gods he was set to guard. Betrayed dragonkind in the War of the Ancients as Deathwing; broke the world in the Cataclysm; unmade by the Dragon Soul.", ["III", "IV", "XI"]),
