# ---------- Peoples & Factions ----------
("alliance", "The Alliance", "PF", "The faction founded as the Alliance of Lordaeron in the Second War; in the modern era led from Stormwind, uniting humans, dwarves, gnomes, night elves, draenei, worgen, and others.", ["VII", "IX"]),
