("burning-legion", "The Burning Legion", "PF", "Sargeras's endless demon army, dedicated to burning every world that might host a world-soul. Invaded Azeroth three times; destroyed forever at Argus.", ["I", "IV", "VI", "VIII", "XII"]),
("draenei", "The draenei", "PF", "\"Exiled ones\": the uncorrupted fragment of the eredar who fled Sargeras with Velen, guided by the naaru, and were nearly annihilated by the corrupted orcs on Draenor. Later joined the Alliance.", ["VI", "IX"]),
